# Source: https://github.com/DC-research/TEMPO @ cd56d7552cb0
# Weights: https://huggingface.co/Melady/TEMPO @ 2d2f7386e10c
# Environment: python 3.12, numpy 2.5.4, torch 2.15.0, transformers 5.22.2,
# peft 0.21.2, CPU
#
# These values pin the current behaviour of upstream ``TEMPO.predict``, which
# has two known problems:
#
# * the forecasts are not on the input scale: airline values are in the
#   hundreds, the forecasts below are not, as ``predict`` and ``forward`` both
#   normalize and the original statistics are lost.
# * config.json builds 6 GPT-2 layers but the checkpoints hold 3, so layers 3-5
#   keep their random initialization. The seed is what makes the values
#   reproducible, and it must be set before the model is built.
#
# If either is fixed in ``sktime.libs.tempo``, these values have to be regenerated.
#
# Generation script:
